<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Claims Management & Settlement</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Deliver on the insurance promise through a high-velocity claims engine that combines 
            customer empathy with rigorous technical and financial oversight.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Mastering the FNOL & Registration</h2>
        <p>
            The claims journey begins with the First Notification of Loss (FNOL). Our system 
            provides a structured interface for capturing all critical loss details—date, 
            peril, location, and description—immediately validating them against the 
            active policy cover to ensure validity. Stakeholders are notified 
            automatically, and a unique claim reference is generated, providing 
            clients with instant reassurance that their case is being handled.
        </p>
        <p>
            Digitized document attachment allows claimants and assessors to upload 
            photographs, police reports, and repair estimates directly into the claim file, 
            creating a comprehensive digital dossier for every incident.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Reserve Accuracy & Financial Control</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain organizational solvency through accurate claims reserving. The system 
            enforces the setting of initial loss reserves on registration, with a full 
            revision history to track changes as more information becomes available. 
            Automated alerts flag claims that have remained unresolved for 
            excessive periods or those with significant reserve variances, enabling 
            proactive management of the organization's total claims liability.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integration with the reinsurance module ensures that potential reinsurance 
            recoveries are identified early, allowing for timely notification to treaty 
            partners and improved cash flow management.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Assessor Orchestration & Salvage</h2>
        <p>
            Coordinate specialized third-party services with ease. Assign claims to authorized 
            assessors, adjusters, or investigators directly through the system. Assessment 
            reports are captured digitally, ensuring that technical findings are 
            permanently linked to the claim record. For total losses, the Salvage Management 
            sub-module tracks the storage, valuation, and sale of recovered assets, 
            ensuring that all legitimate recoveries are maximized and credited back to 
            the insurance fund.
        </p>
        <p>
            Final settlement calculations are performed automatically—deducting policy 
            excesses and applying applicable limits—before routing for payment 
            authorization based on established management authority levels.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

